- A TSL2561 sensor (the small chip in the centre of the blue breakout board)
  is an active, digital sensor. It gives a readout of brightness in Lux using
  the I2C digital protocol. E.g.: ![](images/tsl2561-100x75.jpg "TSL2561 sensor")

